      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DAYSEA'S ELVIS (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (24.22) in a Grade 3/4 at this track. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Can discover winning form. ROCKY RIDE (3) comes off an average run last start when eighth at this track over 407m behind Apollo's Sun (24.48) in a Mix 5. Was in the money prior to that. Form from his last run is proving strong. Should be thereabouts. FAGES (7) continues to race well but is struggling to break through, placing at his last four runs. Last time finished 2nd in a Grade 5 on July 22 over 407m at this track behind Farmor Senior beaten 4 lengths (24.04). Expected to feature. HARA'S FONZIE (2) missed the placings here most recently but can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
